<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐνουργ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>working flax, spinning</i>
			or <i>weaving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., ὁ</span>,
				<i>linen-weaver,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMagd.
				36.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				397.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).137
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντεχνία λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					3.896
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Anazarba</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of <i>goose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
				<u>Av.</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a kind of
				<i>stone</i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				22.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λινουργοί, οἱ</span>, name given to the proletariate, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				34.21
			</span></i>.</div>
